---
kind: lore
id: bonds
title: Bond stories
---
/* Each of the crew has two stories, told once ever when Ilo has earned them. */

<beat use="bondStory" id="brann1" who="brann" need="3" instance="use-001">
  @brann{code="0010"}: My brother dived for the crown. Before your father. Before me.
  @brann{code="0020" emotion="grim"}: He came up once. Said the palace talked to him. Went down again the next morning.
</beat>

<beat use="bondStory" id="brann2" who="brann" need="5" prev="bonds.brann1" instance="use-002">
  @brann{code="0010" emotion="wry"}: I kept his knife. You can have it when you stop coming up dead.
</beat>

<beat use="bondStory" id="sefa1" who="sefa" need="4" instance="use-003">
  @sefa{code="0010" emotion="shy"}: My grandmother didn't just draw the palace. She lived in it. She was a librarian.
</beat>

<beat use="bondStory" id="sefa2" who="sefa" need="6" prev="bonds.sefa1" instance="use-004">
  @sefa{code="0010" emotion="content"}: If the library's open, her books are down there. Her handwriting. Bring me one page.
</beat>

<beat use="bondStory" id="quill1" who="quill" need="4" only="entry.quillFirst.everRead" instance="use-005">
  @quill{code="0010" emotion="sad"}: I had a sister. She sang in the choir. I think she's still singing.
</beat>
